    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_rapport",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "Good networking starts with rapport and genuine curiosity, not with finding the fastest route to ask for a favor."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "شبکه‌سازی خوب با رابطه و کنجکاوی واقعی شروع می‌شه، نه پیدا کردن سریع‌ترین راه برای درخواست لطف."
        },
        "intent": "build_rapport",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_rapport",
          "c1_professional_networking_mutual"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_context",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "When introducing two people, I try to give enough context that each understands why the connection may be relevant."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "وقتی دو نفر رو معرفی می‌کنم، اون‌قدر زمینه می‌دم که هرکدوم بفهمه چرا این ارتباط می‌تونه مرتبط باشه."
        },
        "intent": "make_introduction",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_introduce",
          "c1_professional_networking_context",
          "c1_professional_networking_relevant"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_follow",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "A brief follow-up works better when it refers to something specific from the conversation rather than sounding automated."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "پیگیری کوتاه وقتی بهتر جواب می‌ده که به نکته مشخصی از گفتگو اشاره کنه، نه اینکه خودکار به نظر بیاد."
        },
        "intent": "follow_up_naturally",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_follow_up",
          "c1_professional_networking_context"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_referral",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would ask for a referral only when the person has enough knowledge of my work to make the introduction credible."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "فقط وقتی درخواست معرفی حرفه‌ای می‌کنم که طرف به اندازه کافی کارم رو بشناسه تا معرفی‌اش معتبر باشه."
        },
        "intent": "ask_for_referral",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_referral",
          "c1_professional_networking_relevant"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_mutual",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The relationship becomes more durable when the value is mutual, even if the exchange is not immediate or symmetrical."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "رابطه وقتی ماندگارتر می‌شه که ارزش متقابل باشه، حتی اگر مبادله فوری یا کاملاً برابر نباشه."
        },
        "intent": "describe_mutual_value",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_mutual",
          "c1_professional_networking_reciprocal"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_reciprocal",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Reciprocal does not mean keeping score; it means remaining alert to ways you can be useful as well."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "دوطرفه بودن یعنی حساب‌وکتاب امتیازها نه؛ یعنی حواست باشه تو هم کجا می‌تونی مفید باشی."
        },
        "intent": "clarify_reciprocity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_reciprocal",
          "c1_professional_networking_rapport"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_exit",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "If there is no obvious professional fit, I would still close warmly rather than forcing a connection that is not relevant."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر تناسب حرفه‌ای واضحی نیست، باز هم گرم گفتگو رو می‌بندم به‌جای اینکه ارتباط نامربوط رو به زور بسازم."
        },
        "intent": "close_networking_exchange",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_relevant",
          "c1_professional_networking_rapport"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_professional_networking_longterm",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The strongest networks are usually built through repeated low-pressure contact rather than one highly strategic conversation."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "قوی‌ترین شبکه‌ها معمولاً با ارتباط‌های کم‌فشار و تکرارشونده ساخته می‌شن، نه یک گفتگوی خیلی حساب‌شده."
        },
        "intent": "reflect_on_networking",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_professional_networking_mutual",
          "c1_professional_networking_follow_up"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_professional_networking_register_shift",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-01",
        "slug": "c1-professional-networking-register-shift",
        "title": "Shifting register deliberately",
        "rule_summary": "Adjust vocabulary, directness, contractions, and sentence structure to move appropriately between informal, neutral, and formal contexts.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای جابه‌جایی آگاهانه بین لحن خودمانی، خنثی و رسمی، واژگان، صراحت، contraction و ساختار جمله را تغییر می‌دهیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Can we move this? → Would it be possible to reschedule the meeting?",
            "fa": "می‌شه جابه‌جاش کنیم؟ → آیا امکان تغییر زمان جلسه وجود دارد؟"
          },
          {
            "en": "That's not right. → That interpretation may not fully reflect the evidence.",
            "fa": "این درست نیست. → آن تفسیر ممکن است شواهد را به‌طور کامل بازتاب ندهد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_professional_networking_reduced_relatives",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-02",
        "slug": "c1-professional-networking-reduced-relatives",
        "title": "Reduced relative clauses",
        "rule_summary": "Reduce relative clauses when the meaning remains clear, especially in formal descriptions and summaries.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در توصیف‌ها و خلاصه‌های رسمی، وقتی معنا روشن می‌ماند relative clause را کوتاه می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The measures introduced last year are being reviewed.",
            "fa": "اقداماتی که پارسال معرفی شدند در حال بازبینی‌اند."
          },
          {
            "en": "People working remotely reported fewer interruptions.",
            "fa": "افرادی که دورکاری می‌کردند مزاحمت کمتری گزارش کردند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_professional_networking_diplomatic_language",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-03",
        "slug": "c1-professional-networking-diplomatic-language",
        "title": "Diplomatic challenge and disagreement",
        "rule_summary": "Challenge an idea rather than a person, acknowledge intent, and soften direct negatives while keeping the substantive point clear.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "به‌جای شخص، ایده را به چالش می‌کشیم؛ نیت را می‌پذیریم و بدون مبهم کردن اصل پیام، منفی مستقیم را نرم‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I see the logic, though I'm not convinced the assumption holds in this case.",
            "fa": "منطقش را می‌بینم، هرچند قانع نشده‌ام این فرض در این مورد برقرار باشد."
          },
          {
            "en": "That may be true in principle, but the practical constraints are different.",
            "fa": "در اصل شاید درست باشد، اما محدودیت‌های عملی متفاوت‌اند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_professional_networking_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-professional-networking-01",
        "title": "Professional Networking: part 1",
        "setting": "strategy meeting",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "characters": [
          "Ivy",
          "David"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ivy",
            "text": "What do you make of the way this is being framed?",
            "translation_fa": "از نحوه مطرح شدن این موضوع چه برداشتی داری؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "David",
            "text": "Good networking starts with rapport and genuine curiosity, not with finding the fastest route to ask for a favor.",
            "translation_fa": "شبکه‌سازی خوب با رابطه و کنجکاوی واقعی شروع می‌شه، نه پیدا کردن سریع‌ترین راه برای درخواست لطف."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ivy",
            "text": "Is there another interpretation we should keep in view?",
            "translation_fa": "تفسیر دیگه‌ای هست که باید در نظر داشته باشیم؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "David",
            "text": "When introducing two people, I try to give enough context that each understands why the connection may be relevant.",
            "translation_fa": "وقتی دو نفر رو معرفی می‌کنم، اون‌قدر زمینه می‌دم که هرکدوم بفهمه چرا این ارتباط می‌تونه مرتبط باشه."
